  "note": "铁盾会院子、会首的屋 (native:fanfang/shield_yard, shield_hall; 番坊 B): behind the heavy gate a great yard of raked sand trodden into footprints, the rough stone compound wall round it (the same stone as its street front), the shield racks along the north wall with the round shields rim to rim, the hacked posts on the east, a rack of short swords, water vats by the gate, a bench, sandbags; torches on the hall's front, the lane worn from the gate to its door. The 会首's low stone hut north of it: a red-and-yellow carpet, the low table with its copper lamp, bedding rolls along the walls, the old shield leaning on the north wall and the wooden tablet beside it, a barred window. Old and used: sand kicked over the flags at the gate, sweat-dark posts, chips, the hut's walls smoked over the lamp.",
